{
 "id": "person-david-country",
 "song": "/Users/vhanssen/WebstormProjects/flogvit/music/YuE/outputs/catalog/person-david-country",
 "offset_seconds": -2.5400000000002017,
 "words_heard": 242,
 "words": 254,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Out on the hills by Bethlehem a ruddy shepherd boy",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.85,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Kept his father's flock by night and sang his songs of joy",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 1.02,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Seven brothers passed the prophet, tall and fine to see",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.9,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But the LORD looks at the heart, and the youngest one was he",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.61,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Down in the Valley of Elah a giant cursed and roared",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.58,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The soldiers stood there trembling, every hand upon a sword",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.19,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A boy ran out with just a sling, a stone and nothing more",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And the giant fell before him, for the battle belongs to the LORD",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.63,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Shepherd boy and giant-slayer, harp-player and king",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A heart that ran to God in every song he'd sing",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He fell and he got up again, he wept and he believed",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.57,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The LORD looks at the heart, and a broken heart's received",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.57,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Up on a palace rooftop in the evening's fading light",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.91,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A king took what was not his and hid it out of sight",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.88,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Then Nathan stood before him and said, You are the man",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.85,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And David fell before the LORD and wept with empty hands",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.84,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Have mercy on me, O God",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Wash me, and I will be whiter than snow",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.41,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Create in me a clean heart, O God",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.74,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Renew a steadfast spirit within me",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.51,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Shepherd boy and giant-slayer, harp-player and king",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.43,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A heart that ran to God in every song he'd sing",
   "heard": 11,
